# Listing image metadata directory
#
# Each real listing gets ONE .json file here named after its id, e.g.
#   28.AY.0142.json
#
# Schema is defined in `src/content.config.ts` (zod). The Astro glob loader
# picks up every `*.json` under this directory EXCEPT files / dirs starting
# with `_` — that's why the bundled `_example-*.json` is treated as a static
# template rather than as runtime data.
#
# See `docs/dev/images.md` for the full drop-file → metadata → build flow.
